[{"title":"DefaultListModel类","url":"/2026/09/09/Java%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8API/swing%E7%BB%84%E4%BB%B6/DefaultListModel%E7%B1%BB/","content":"<p>方法：<br>1.增加元素（尾插）</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void addElement(E element)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>2.增加元素（插入指定位置索引）</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void insertElementAt(E element, int index)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<pre><code>参数1：要插入的元素\n参数2：要插入的位置\n</code></pre>\n<p>3.修改指定位置元素</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void setElementAt(E element, int index)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>4.删除元素（第一个出现的位置）</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public boolean removeElement(Object obj)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>5.删除所有元素，并将大小设置为0</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void removeAllElements()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>6.删除指定位置的元素，并返回被删除的元素</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public E remove(int index)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>7.将某个集合的元素一次性添加</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void addAll(Collection&lt;? extends E&gt; c)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>8.在指定的索引后面将某个集合的元素一次性添加</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void addAll(int index, Collection&lt;? extends E&gt; c)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n","categories":["Java基础api"],"tags":["swing组件","Java"]},{"title":"JList类","url":"/2026/09/09/Java%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8API/swing%E7%BB%84%E4%BB%B6/JList%E7%B1%BB/","content":"<p>静态变量：<br>    VERTICAL &#x3D; 0;        &#x2F;&#x2F;表示单元格的垂直布局，集中在一列中;默认布局<br>    VERTICAL_WRAP &#x3D; 1;   &#x2F;&#x2F;表示“报纸风格”布局，单元先垂直再横向排列<br>    HORIZONTAL_WRAP &#x3D; 2; &#x2F;&#x2F;表示“报纸风格”布局，单元格横向流动，然后垂直排列</p>\n<p>构造方法：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public JList(final E[] listData)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<pre><code>参数：一个数组\n</code></pre>\n<p>方法：<br>1.添加组件或容器</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">add()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>2.设置可见行数</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void setVisibleRowCount(int visibleRowCount)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>3.设置默认选中</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void setSelectionInterval(int anchor, int lead)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<pre><code>参数1：起始索引\n参数2：末尾索引\n</code></pre>\n<p>3.定义了列表单元格的布局方式</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void setLayoutOrientation(int layoutOrientation)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>4.设置列表的选择模式<br>这是一种覆盖方法，直接在选择模型上设置选择模式</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void setSelectionMode(int selectionMode)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<pre><code>ListSelectionModel.SINGLE_SELECTION - 单选\nListSelectionModel.SINGLE_INTERVAL_SELECTION - 一次只能选择一个连续区间\nListSelectionModel.MULTIPLE_INTERVAL_SELECTION - 无限制，可多选，默认形式\n</code></pre>\n<p>5.获取选项值，封装成列表形式返回，以此应对多选的情况</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public List&lt;E&gt; getSelectedValuesList()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>6.选项发生变化监听器</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void addListSelectionListener(ListSelectionListener listener)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<pre><code>向列表中添加一个监听器，每次选择发生变化时都会收到通知\n选择状态变化的首选聆听方式\nJList 负责监听选择模型中的选择状态变化，并通知给定的监听者每一次变化\n</code></pre>\n<p>7.设置模型   涉及类： <a href=\"DefaultListModel%E7%B1%BB.md\">DefaultListModel</a></p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void setModel(ListModel&lt;E&gt; model)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<pre><code>搭配DefaultListModel使用可实现动态增删改\n</code></pre>\n","categories":["Java基础api"],"tags":["swing组件","Java"]},{"title":"JTablePane类","url":"/2026/09/09/Java%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8API/swing%E7%BB%84%E4%BB%B6/JTablePane%E7%B1%BB/","content":"<p>静态变量：<br>布局策略<br>int WRAP_TAB_LAYOUT &#x3D; 0      &#x2F;&#x2F;换行<br>int SCROLL_TAB_LAYOUT &#x3D; 1    &#x2F;&#x2F;滚轮</p>\n<p>构造方法：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public JTabbedPane(int tabPlacement, int tabLayoutPolicy)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<pre><code>参数1：组件所在的位置\n参数2：布局策略\n</code></pre>\n<p>方法：<br>1.添加标签</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void addTab(String title, Icon icon, Component component, String tip)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<pre><code>参数1：标签名\n参数2：标签的图片\n参数3：标签绑定的组件\n参数4：标签的提示\n</code></pre>\n<p>2.设置索引标签是否启用</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void setEnabledAt(int index, boolean enabled)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>3.设置默认选项</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void setSelectedIndex(int index)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<pre><code>设置该标签面板的选定索引。\n索引必须是有效的制表索引或 -1，\n</code></pre>\n<p>4.返回当前所选的标签的索引</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public int getSelectedIndex()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>5.选项改变监听</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void addChangeListener(ChangeListener l)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<pre><code>改变选项时发生\n但是选项标签页的内容改变不需要使用这个\n</code></pre>\n","categories":["Java基础api"],"tags":["swing组件","Java"]},{"title":"JOptionPane类","url":"/2026/09/09/Java%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8API/swing%E7%BB%84%E4%BB%B6/JOptionPane%E7%B1%BB/","content":"<p>静态变量：<br>5类<br><em>INFORMATION</em>             &#x2F;&#x2F;提示消息<br><em>ERROR_MESSAGE</em>         &#x2F;&#x2F;错误消息<br><em>WARNING_MESSAGE</em>   &#x2F;&#x2F;警告<br><em>QUESTION_MESSAGE</em>  &#x2F;&#x2F;询问<br><em>PLAIN_MESSAGE</em>         &#x2F;&#x2F;普通</p>\n<p>方法：<br>1.消息对话框</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public static void showMessageDialog(Component parentComponent,  </span><br><span class=\"line\">    Object message, String title, int messageType,Icon icon);</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<pre><code>参数1：父窗口\n参数2：消息\n参数3：标题\n参数4：消息类型\n参数5：自定义消息类型的图片\n无返回值\n</code></pre>\n<p>2.确认对话框</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public static int showConfirmDialog(Component parentComponent,  </span><br><span class=\"line\">    Object message, String title, int optionType,  </span><br><span class=\"line\">    int messageType, Icon icon)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<pre><code>参数定义类似\n可以指定消息类型\n可以指定选项为yes or no 或者 ok or canel\n或者yes or no or canel的情况也是有的\n返回值：int 类型 为所选选项的值，如yes --- 1\n</code></pre>\n<p>3.输入对话框</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public static Object showInputDialog(Component parentComponent,  </span><br><span class=\"line\">    Object message, String title, int messageType, Icon icon,  </span><br><span class=\"line\">    Object[] selectionValues, Object initialSelectionValue)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<pre><code>参数1：父容器\n参数2：文本框的标题\n参数3：文本框所在容器--对话框 的标题\n参数4：消息类型\n参数5：自定义图标\n参数6：可选的内容\n参数7：初始化的文本框内容\n返回值：Object 类型 返回文本框的内容\n</code></pre>\n<p>4.选项对话框</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public static int showOptionDialog(Component parentComponent,  </span><br><span class=\"line\">    Object message, String title, int optionType, int messageType,  </span><br><span class=\"line\">    Icon icon, Object[] options, Object initialValue)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<pre><code>options：选项，会覆盖optionType\ninitialValue：初始选项，如果此参数的值在options不存在，会被忽略，效果等同于null\n返回值，int 类型 一号选项为0，二号选项为1，以此从左往右类推\n</code></pre>\n","categories":["Java基础api"],"tags":["swing组件","Java"]},{"title":"JProgressBar类","url":"/2026/09/09/Java%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8API/swing%E7%BB%84%E4%BB%B6/JProgressBar%E7%B1%BB/","content":"<p>关联类<br>BoundedRangeModel   模型<br>ProgressMonitor  进度对话框</p>\n<p>方法：<br>1.设置进度条的模式</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void setIndeterminate(boolean newValue)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<pre><code>true：确定模式，可以看到进度\nfalse：不确定模式，只能看到一个循环的动画\n</code></pre>\n<p>2.获取百分比进度</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void setStringPainted(boolean b)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<pre><code>true：显示百分比进度\nfalse：不显示\n</code></pre>\n<p>3.设置是否显示边框</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void setBorderPainted(boolean b)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>4.设置进度</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void setValue(int n)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>5.获取模型</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public BoundedRangeModel getModel() &#123;  </span><br><span class=\"line\">    return model;  </span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":["Java基础api"],"tags":["swing组件","Java"]},{"title":"Linux常用命令","url":"/2026/09/10/Java%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8API/Linux/Linux%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/","content":"<p>列出目录下的内容（横向展示）</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">ls [option] [Linux路径]\t</span><br><span class=\"line\">\toption：</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-a</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t显示隐藏文件</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-l</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t竖向展示，并展示更多信息，如权限，创建时间，大小（没有单位）</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-h</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t以容易阅读的方式列出文件的大小，如K、M、G</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t必须搭配 -l 一起使用</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>切换路径</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">cd [Linux路径]</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>输出当前的路径</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">pwd</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>路径符号解释</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">路径</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t.</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t当前目录</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t/</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t绝对路径</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t..</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t上一级目录</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t~</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\tHOME目录</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>创建空文件夹</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">mkdir [option] [Linux路径]</span><br><span class=\"line\">\toption</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-p</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t自动创建不存在的父目录</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t用于创建连续多级目录</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>创建空文件</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">touch [Linux路径]</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>查看文件内容，全部显示</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">cat [Linux路径]\t</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>查看文件内容，支持翻页</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">more [Linux路径]</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>复制文件\\文件夹</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">cp [option] 参数1 参数2</span><br><span class=\"line\">\toption</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-r</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t递归复制</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t如果有子文件夹一起复制</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t参数1</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\tLinux路径，表示被复制的文件</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t参数2</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\tLinux路径，表示要复制去的地方</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>移动文件&#x2F;文件夹</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">mv 参数1 参数2 </span><br><span class=\"line\">\t参数1</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\tLinux路径，表示被移动的文件或文件夹</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t参数2</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\tLinux路径，表示要移动去的地方</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t如果文件那个地方不存在，则改名，确保目标存在</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>删除文件、文件夹</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">rm [option] 参数1 参数2……参数N</span><br><span class=\"line\">\toption</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-r：删除文件夹</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-f：强制删除</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t参数：</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t要删除的文件、文件夹</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>查找命令所在的路径</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">which 命令</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>按文件名查找文件</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">find 起始路径 [option] filename\t</span><br><span class=\"line\">\toption</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-name</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t以文件名的方式去查找</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-type</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t文件类型</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\tf</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t\t普通文件</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\td</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t\t目录</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\tl</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t\t链接</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-user</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t按文件所有者查找</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-group</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t按文件所属组查找</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tfilename</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t文件名</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>按文件大小去查找文件</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">find 起始路径 [option] +|-n[KMG]</span><br><span class=\"line\">\toption</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-size</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t以文件大小的方式查找</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t+</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t大于</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t小于</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tn</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t大小数字</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t+-号和数字之间没有空格</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tkMG</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t大小单位</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t注意k是小写</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>从文件中通过关键字过滤文件行</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">grep [option] 关键字 文件路径</span><br><span class=\"line\">\toption</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-n</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t表示在结果中显示匹配的行号</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-i</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t忽略大小写</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-v</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t反向查找，只打印不匹配的行</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-c</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t只打印匹配的行数</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-r</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t递归查找</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-l</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t只打印匹配的文件名</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t关键字</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t过滤的关键字，带有空格或其他特殊符号，需要使用引号包围</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t文件路径</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t要过滤内容的文件路径，可作为内容的输入端口</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>统计文件的行数，单词数量等</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">wc [option] 文件路径</span><br><span class=\"line\">\toption</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-c</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t统计字节数量</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-m</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t统计字符数量</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-l</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t统计行数</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-w</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t统计单词数量</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t无参数的情况下输出</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t行数，单词数，字节数量和文件名称</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t文件路径</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t被统计的文件，可作为内容的输入端口</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>管道符，把管道符左边命令的输出作为右边命令的输入</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">|</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>将内容输出在终端，如果要输的内容是通过命令得到的，需要使用反引号包围命令</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">echo 输出的内容\t</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>重定向符号，将左边的内容以 <em><strong>覆盖</strong></em> 的方式写入右边</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>重定向符号，将左边的内容以 <em><strong>追加</strong></em> 的方式写入右边</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">&gt;&gt; </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>查看文件尾部内容</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">tail [option] Linux路径 </span><br><span class=\"line\">\t option</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t -f</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t 持续跟踪</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-num</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t表示查看尾部多少行</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t默认10行</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>文本编辑</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">vim 文件名\t</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t快捷键</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\ti</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t进入编辑模式</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\tesc</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t退出编辑模式</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t非编辑模式</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\tyy</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t快速复制（光标所在行）</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\tnyy</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t复制当前行和下面n行</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\tp</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t粘贴复制内容</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\tdd</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t快速删除（光标所在行）</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\tndd</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t从当前行开始，向下快速删除n行</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\tu</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t撤销</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\tctrl+r</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t反向撤销</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t/</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t进入搜索模式</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t搜索模式</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\tn</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t\t向下搜索</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\tN</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t\t向上搜索</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\tgg</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t去首行</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\tG</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t去最后一行</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t:wq</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t保存退出</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t:q</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t仅退出</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t:q!</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t强制退出</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t:set nu</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t显示行号</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t:set paste</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t设置粘贴模式（确保格式正确）</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>超级用户</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">root用户</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tsu - root</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t切换超级用户</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\tsu - [用户名]</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t输入不同的用户名可以切换成不同的用户</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t-</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t加载相应的环境变量</span><br><span class=\"line\">\texit</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t退出当前用户</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tctrl+d</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t切换回上一个用户</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>临时  用root用户权限  使用该命令</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">sudo 命令</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t配置</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t/etc/sudoers文件夹</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t在文件的最后加上</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t用户名 ALL=(ALL)      NOPASSWORD:ALL</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t这样配置后使用sudo不需要输入密码</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>创建&#x2F;删除用户组，需要root权限</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">groupadd 用户组名</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">groupdel 用户组名</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>创建&#x2F;删除用户</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">useradd [option] 用户名</span><br><span class=\"line\">\toption</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-g</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t指定组</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t不指定组会创建同名的组并加入</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t使用该选项需要确保组存在</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t如果已有同名组，则必须使用-g</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-d</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t指定用户的HOME路径</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t不指定则默认为/home/用户名</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t</span><br><span class=\"line\">userdel [option] 用户名</span><br><span class=\"line\">\toption</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-r</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t删除用户的HOME目录</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t不删除则保留</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>查看用户所属组，如果不提供用户名，则查看自身</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">id [用户名]</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>指定用户加入指定组</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">usermod [option] 用户组 用户名</span><br><span class=\"line\">\toption</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-a</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-G</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>查看当前系统中有哪些用户</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">getent passwd</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>文件权限相关解释</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">文件权限</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t第一位</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\td</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t文件夹</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t文件</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\tl</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t软链接</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t2到4位</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\tr</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t可读，如ls</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\tw</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t可写，如vim</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\tx</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t可执行，如cd</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t5到7位同上</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t8到10位同上</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>修改文件，文件夹的权限</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">chmod [option] 权限 文件或文件夹</span><br><span class=\"line\">\toption</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-R</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t对文件夹内全部内容应用同样的操作</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tchmod u=rwx,g=rwx,o=rwx text</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tchmod 751 text</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t751二进制表示法</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\tu</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t111---&gt;rwx</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\tg</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t101---&gt;r-x</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\to</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t001---&gt;--x</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>修改文件、文件夹的所属用户和所属组，只适用于root用户</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">chown [-R] [用户][:][用户组] 文件或文件夹 </span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-R</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t同chmod</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t[用户]</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t修改所属用户</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t[用户组]</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t修改所属用户组</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t[:]</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t用于分隔用户和用户组，如果修改的只有用户组则需要加</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>服务管理</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">systemctl start | stop | status | enable | disable 服务名</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tstart</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t启动</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tstop</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t停止</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tstatus</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t状态</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tenable</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t开机自启</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tdisable</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t关闭开机自启</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>建立软链接</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">ln -s 参数1 参数2</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-s</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t创建软链接</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t参数1</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t被链接的文件或文件夹</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t参数2</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t要链接去的目的地</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>查看时间</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">date  [-d] [+格式化字符串]</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-d</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t按照给定的字符串显示日期</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t一般用于日期计算</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t支持计算的时间单位</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\tyear</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\tmonth</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\tday</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\thour</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\tminute</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\tsecond</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t计算方式</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\tdate -d &quot;+1 day&quot;</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t格式化字符串</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t%Y</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t年</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t%y</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t年份后两位数字</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t%M</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t月份</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t%d</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t日</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t%H</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t小时</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t%M</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t分钟</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t%S</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t秒</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t%s</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t从1970.1.1到现在的时间</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>查看&#x2F;设置主机名</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">hostname</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">set hostname</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>查看进程信息</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">ps [option]</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-e</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t显示全部</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-u</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t用户指定格式显示进程状态</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-f</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t以完全格式化的形式展示</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\tUID</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t进程所属用户ID</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\tPID</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t进程的进程号</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\tPPID</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t进程的父ID</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\tC</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t占用cpu百分比</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\tSTIME</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t进程的启动时间</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\tTTY</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t启动进程的终端序号，非终端启动显示?</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\tTIME</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t占用cpu的时间</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\tCMD</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t\t对应的启动路径或启动命令</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>关闭进程</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">kill -9 进程ID</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-9</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t强制关闭</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>查看cpu，内存使用情况，类似任务管理器</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">top [option]</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-p</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t只显示某个进程的信息</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-d</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t设置刷新时间，默认为5秒</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-c</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t显示产生进程的完整命令，默认是进程名</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-n</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t指定刷新次数，如top -n 3 刷新3次后退出</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-b</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t以非交互非全屏模式运行，以批次的方式执行</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-i</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t不显示无用或闲置的进程</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-u</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t查找指定用户启动的线程</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p><strong>查看硬盘的使用情况</strong></p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">df [-h]</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-h</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t以更人性化的单位显示</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>查看cpu、磁盘的相关信息</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">iostat [-x] [num1] [num2]</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-x</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t显示更多信息</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tnum1</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t数字，刷新间隔</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tnum2</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t数字，刷新次数</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>查看网络相关统计</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">sar -n DEV num1 num2</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-n</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t查看网络</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tDEV</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t表示查看网络接口</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tnum1</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t数字，刷新间隔</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tnum2</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t数字，刷新次数</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>压缩文件后缀</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">.tar</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t归档文件</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t简单的整合文件</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t文件大小并没有多大的变化</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">.gz</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t常见为.tar.gz，gzip格式压缩文件</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t极大的减少压缩后的体积</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>压缩或解压缩，tar文件用tar命令，zip文件用zip命令（zip解压用unzip）</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">tar [option] 参数1 参数2 …</span><br><span class=\"line\">\toption</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-c</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t创建压缩文件，用于压缩模式</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-v</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t显示压缩、解压过程，用于查看进度</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-x</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t解压模式</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-f</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t要创建的文件，或解压的文件</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t该选项必须要放在所有首选的最后</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-z</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\tgzip模式</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t不使用就是普通的.tar文件</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t-C</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t\t选择解压的目录，用于解压模式</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t压缩示例</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\ttar -zcvf test.tar.gz test1 test2 test3</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t解压实例</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\ttar -zxvf test.tar.gz -C 要解压到的目录</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">zip [-r] 参数1 参数2 …… 参数N</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-r</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t被压缩文件包含文件夹时需要使用</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>解压zip文件</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">unzip [-d] 参数</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-d</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t指定要解压的目录</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t参数</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t指被解压的文件</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>查看Linux系统信息</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">uname [option]</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-r</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t查看Linux内核版本</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>查看Linux发行版信息</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">cat /etc/-release</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>查看文件夹大小</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">du </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>查看系统内存的使用情况</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">free -h</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t-h</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t以人类易于阅读的方式展示</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":["Linux"],"tags":["Linux基础"]},{"title":"JComboBox类","url":"/2026/09/09/Java%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8API/swing%E7%BB%84%E4%BB%B6/JComboBox%E7%B1%BB/","content":"<p>构造方法</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public JComboBox(E[] items)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<pre><code>类似于JList\n</code></pre>\n<p>方法：<br>1.设置列表框可否编辑，默认false不可编辑</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void setEditable(boolean aFlag)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>2.设置最大可见数量，超出的用滚轮显示</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void setMaximumRowCount(int count)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>3.选项监听</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void addItemListener(ItemListener aListener)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>4.获取选择的选项</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public Object getSelectedItem()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":["Java基础api"],"tags":["swing组件","Java"]},{"title":"JSplitPane类","url":"/2026/09/09/Java%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8API/swing%E7%BB%84%E4%BB%B6/JSplitPane%E7%B1%BB/","content":"<p>静态变量：<br>VERTICAL_SPLIT&#x3D;0    &#x2F;&#x2F;纵向分割<br>HORIZONTAL_SPLIT&#x3D;1  &#x2F;&#x2F;横向分割</p>\n<p>构造方法：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public JSplitPane(int newOrientation,  </span><br><span class=\"line\">                  Component newLeftComponent,  </span><br><span class=\"line\">                  Component newRightComponent)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<pre><code>参数1：通过静态变量决定分割的方向\n参数2：左上的容器\n参数3：右下的容器\n</code></pre>\n<p>方法：<br>1.设置一键拉动分割条到另一端</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void setOneTouchExpandable(boolean newValue)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>2.设置平滑滑动分割条</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void setContinuousLayout(boolean newContinuousLayout)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":["Java基础api"],"tags":["swing组件","Java"]},{"title":"ProgressMonitor类","url":"/2026/09/09/Java%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8API/swing%E7%BB%84%E4%BB%B6/ProgressMonitor%E7%B1%BB/","content":"<p>构造方法：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public ProgressMonitor(Component parentComponent,  </span><br><span class=\"line\">                       Object message,  </span><br><span class=\"line\">                       String note,  </span><br><span class=\"line\">                       int min,  </span><br><span class=\"line\">                       int max)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<pre><code>参数1：父组件，可以为null\n参数2：信息，不会改变\n参数3：信息，可能改变\n参数4：最小值\n参数5：最大值\n</code></pre>\n<p>2.关闭对话框</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public void close()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>3.返回用户是否点击取消按钮</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">public boolean isCanceled()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n\n","categories":["Java基础api"],"tags":["swing组件","Java"]},{"title":"link","url":"/link/index.html","content":""},{"title":"tags","url":"/tags/index.html","content":""},{"title":"categories","url":"/categories/index.html","content":""}]